                "text": "The #OneBigUglyBill is a disaster for America. Record cuts to healthcare. Record cuts to nutrition. Record $5.3T in debt. All to pay for billionaire tax cuts we can\u2019t afford.\n\n17 million Americans will lose their healthcare and many people will sadly die as a result. Seniors, kids and the disabled will go hungry.\n\nThe bill raises healthcare, energy and loan interest costs.\n\nUltimately it\u2019s the largest transfer of wealth to the richest Americans in our nation\u2019s history.\n\nI will vote NO!",
