                "text": "Top 5 Reasons the #OneBigUglyBill is Wrong for #FL9:\n\ud83c\udfe5 Record cuts to healthcare - KidCare, Nursing Home Care, Obamacare and Medicare - hurts kids, seniors, veterans, disabled & working poor the hardest \n\n\ud83e\udd56 Record Cuts to Nutrition (SNAP) - many Americans already struggling with grocery costs will go hungry\n\n\ud83d\udcb5 Record $5.3T added to National Debt - will raise interest rates too\n\n\u26a1\ufe0f Raises energy costs / kills some clean energy projects\n\n\ud83e\uddd0 All to pay for billionaire tax cuts we can\u2019t afford\n\nThis is why the bill is DEEPLY UNPOPULAR already with nearly 60% of Americans opposed.",
